+| Preserve failures and test scope | Earlier failures retained; new code/result and manual-versus-machine limits disclosed | Neither integrity nor publication validates historical conclusions |
+| Carry missing inputs forward | Five next-input groups above; all five tracks/eighteen criteria remain open | No missing original or empirical test marked complete |
